Murkwater Surface is a field effect present in Rejuvenation. It is classified as an Elemental field. A notable user of the field is [[Erick]], during his gym battle.

==Transitions From Other Fields==

* [[Icy Field]] will transform into this field if Murkwater Surface is below the field, and any of the following moves are used:
** Bulldoze, Dive, Earthquake, Eruption, Fire Pledge, Fissure, Flame Burst, Heat Wave, Incinerate, Inferno Overdrive, Lava Plume, [[Magma Drift]], Magnitude, Mind Blown, Raging Fury, Searing Shot, Scald (x2), Steam Eruption, Tectonic Rage
** ''The ice melted away!''
** ''The hot water melted the ice!''
** ''The quake broke up the ice and revealed the water beneath!''
** ''The ice was broken from underneath!''
* [[Water Surface]] and [[Underwater]] will transform into this field if Sludge Wave is used 2 times or Acid Downpour is used 1 time. If [[Underwater]] is transformed, all non-Poison and non-Steel-type Pokémon on the field will faint. 
** ''The grime sank beneath the battlers! The water was polluted!''

==General Effects==

* Water-type attacks increase in base power by 1.5x and gain a Poison sub-typing.
** ''The toxic water strengthened the attack!''
* Poison-type attacks increase in base power by 1.5x.
** ''The toxic water strengthened the attack!''
* Electric-type attacks increase in base power by 1.3x.
** ''The toxic water conducted the attack!''
* Ground-type attacks fail on use.
** ''...But there was no solid ground to attack from!''
* Grounded Pokémon have their Speed decreased to 0.75x, unless they are Water-type or have one of the abilities Surge Surfer or Swift Swim.

===Field damage===

* Grounded non-Poison or Steel-type Pokémon take type-scaling Poison damage at the end of each turn, with normal damage equal to 1/8 max HP. 
** ''[Pokémon] was hurt by the toxic water!''
** Pokémon take no field damage if they have one of the abilities Immunity, Magic Guard, Pastel Veil, Poison Heal, Surge Surfer, Toxic Boost or Wonder Guard.
** Pokémon take x2 field damage if have one of the abilities Dry Skin, Flame Body, Magma Armor or Water Absorb
** Pokémon take x4 field damage when using Dive.
*** ''[Pokémon] suffocated underneath the toxic water!''

==Abilities affected==

* Dry Skin and Water Absorb additionally restore 1/8 of the bearer's max HP each turn if it is grounded and Poison-type.
** ''[Pokémon] was healed by the poisoned water!''
* Gooey now lowers Speed by 2 stages on activation.
* Liquid Ooze now deals double damage on activation.
* Merciless, Schooling, Surge Surfer, Swift Swim, and Toxic Boost are always activated.
* Mimicry changes the user's type to Poison.
* Poison Heal additionally restores 1/8 of the bearer's max HP each turn if it is grounded.
** ''[Pokémon] was healed by the poisoned water!''
* Stench's activation rate is doubled to 20%.
* Water Compaction is activated at the end of each turn.

==Moves affected==

===Moves which receive a buff===

* Mud Barrage, Mud Bomb, Mud Shot, Mud Slap, Thousand Waves → 1.5x boost, deal Water-type damage, Poison sub-typing.
** ''The toxic water strengthened the attack!''
* Apple Acid, Smack Down → 1.5x boost, Poison sub-typing.
** ''The toxic water strengthened the attack!''
* Acid, Acid Spray, Brine →  1.5x boost.
** ''The toxic water strengthened the attack!''
** ''Stinging!''

===Other moves===

* Acid Armor boosts the user's Defense by 3 stages.
* Barb Barrage and Venoshock double in power regardless of status.
* Life Dew and Tar Shot additionally Poison their targets.
* Shore Up additionally activates Water Compaction.
* Sludge Wave gains a Water sub-typing.
* Spikes and Toxic Spikes fail on use.
** ''...The spikes sank into the water and vanished!''
* Venom Drench can be activated regardless of status.

===Field-dependent moves===

* Camouflage changes the user's type to Poison.
* Nature Power becomes Sludge Wave.
* Secret Power may inflict Poison.
* Shelter halves damage from Poison-type moves.
* Terrain Pulse's type becomes Poison.

==Transitions to Other Fields==

'''Any move in this section inherently gains a 1.3x damage boost if it changes the field, unless noted otherwise.'''

* This field will transform into [[Water Surface]] if either of the moves Purify or Whirlpool is used.
** ''The attack cleared the waters!''
** ''The maelstrom flushed out the poison!''
* This field will transform into [[Icy Field]] if one of the moves Blizzard, Glaciate, or Subzero Slammer is used.
** ''The toxic water froze over!''

==Items==

* [[Elemental Seed]] raises Speed by 1 stage and applies Aqua Ring, but poisons the user.

